WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:18.965
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:18.966 --> 00:00:22.866
I'm a gray wolf.

3
00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:27.660
Wolves are a kind of wild dog.

4
00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:32.713
We're bigger than most pet dogs.

5
00:00:32.714 --> 00:00:35.490
Where do you live?

6
00:00:35.491 --> 00:00:39.408
I live in the United States.

7
00:00:39.409 --> 00:00:43.935
Wolves live in other parts of the world too.

8
00:00:43.936 --> 00:00:49.519
We live in forests and tundra, and on prairies.

9
00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:52.870
Are you dangerous?

10
00:00:52.871 --> 00:00:57.036
Lots of people think we're dangerous.

11
00:00:57.037 --> 00:01:01.198
But we almost never hurt people.

12
00:01:01.199 --> 00:01:04.176
What do you eat?

13
00:01:04.177 --> 00:01:09.296
Sometimes we eat small animals like hares.

14
00:01:09.297 --> 00:01:14.276
We also hunt bison and moose.

15
00:01:14.277 --> 00:01:19.196
Whoa! Bison and moose are big animals!

16
00:01:19.197 --> 00:01:24.153
Yes, but wolves live in packs.

17
00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:28.625
We all work together to hunt big prey.

18
00:01:28.626 --> 00:01:32.381
How do wolves learn to hunt?

19
00:01:32.382 --> 00:01:36.399
Cubs learn by playing.

20
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.168
They pretend to fight each other.

21
00:01:40.169 --> 00:01:47.508
And they chase small animals.

22
00:01:47.509 --> 00:01:50.628
What's that sound?

23
00:01:50.629 --> 00:01:54.098
That's our pack leader.

24
00:01:54.099 --> 00:02:00.091
He howls to keep our pack together.

25
00:02:00.092 --> 00:02:04.075
I've got to join my pack now.

26
00:02:04.076 --> 00:02:07.056
Good-bye!

27
00:02:07.057 --> 00:02:14.527
Good-bye, Gray Wolf!
